  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENDING VIOLENCE AGAINST WOMEN &amp; GIRLS AND ADVANCING WOMEN&#xbf;S LEADERSHIP IN THE PUBLIC SECTOR IN ZANZIBAR &amp; TANZANIA MAINLAND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The intervention aims at accelerating progress towards gender equality and the empowerment of women and girls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome:1 &lt;/strong&gt;Enhanced freedom from all forms of gender-based violence in the public and private spheres, in schools, workplace and online for women, men, girls, and boys in Zanzibar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcome 2: &lt;/strong&gt;Women&#xbf;s participation and leadership in decision-making in the public and private sectors is promoted, and women and girls benefit from gender-responsive governance.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
